        8
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://unitedstatesghosttowns.com/doole-texas-ghost-town/"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "A 1950s drought forced many farmers to abandon operations, accelerating Doole’s decline.",
